{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32107","headline":"送友人之南陵 · 贾岛","name":"送友人之南陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫叹徒劳向宦途，不羣气岸有谁如。\n南陵暂掌仇香印，北阙终行贾谊书。\n好趂江山寻胜境，莫辞韦杜别幽居。\n少年跃马同心使，免得诗中道跨驴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}